doodle-jump -- a Doodle Jump game
=================================

A Doodle Jump game written in Python with pygame.  Records are kept in
an SQLite database: enter your nickname in the main menu to save yours.

Screenshots:
https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/79650307/227780633-9eb0e835-50d6-4a2e-a601-bb3f7e3bb598.png
https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/79650307/227780675-4730020d-a2e6-437f-a5b7-bbc7224aaaf5.png

Requirements
------------

Python 3 and pygame (see requirements.txt).

Using it
--------

Clone this repository and change to its directory:

    git clone https://github.com/mb6ockatf/doodle-jump.git
    cd doodle-jump

Start the game:

    python3 src/main.py

Insert your nickname in the main menu to save the record.

Controls:

    Right arrow, d         move to the right
    Left arrow, a          move to the left
    Space, Up arrow, w     pause
    Escape                 pause or exit

Reporting bugs
--------------

Report bugs at https://github.com/mb6ockatf/doodle-jump/issues.  The
project is open for contribution: feel free to fork it, make pull
requests or email me (see CONTRIBUTING).

